{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgUhKREsf4W21v1cvpPh6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The day28 ratchet gate is green (exit 0). I added new assertions only; no existing one was changed or deleted.\n\n1. **Metadata:** I merged `disk.partition_start_lba_sequence` (D28, verified) into a new `lib/meta/disk.py`, with its `_BUILTIN` entry. It reads the start sectors from a GPT partition table, or from an older MBR table if there's no GPT. It reproduces `[34]` on the Single; the TT `[60,93,148]` and all 12 Mastery sets were confirmed by the GM with the same code in the day solver. No prebuilt module had this field.\n2. **Warmups:** I added the D28 codec `hex-reversed` to `DAYS` in `lib/warmups_codecs.py`: lowercase hex of the text, with the whole hex string reversed. It is byte-exact on the Single, the TT (96c99781) and 138/138 lines 28 of Mastery cd6a5b33. It is not free text, so it does not go in `FREE_CODECS`.\n3. **Speed fix the gate needed:** the gate failed a timing check: the metadata lane solver took 1.10 s on a 12-set Mastery case against a 1 s limit. My D28 entry wasn't the cause (without it the case took 1.45 s). I fixed it in `lib/common.py` (each lookup no longer rescans all 396 questions) and in `lib.meta` (a faster read of the prebuilt field tables, which returns exactly the same dicts on all 155 modules it handles). The case now takes ~0.88 s with 396/396 answers still correct.\n4. **Tests:** new checks in `tests/test_day7_fixes.py` for the D28 codec (including Mastery line 28), the disk field (GPT and MBR) and both speed fixes.\n5. **Rejected:** there were no lib proposals from today's workers. Binary had two real rejections (d13 `crystal_symbol_count` 1255, final 771; d20 `overlay_size` 19, final 463), but both were bugs in that solver against fully specified questions, not reusable facts. Web, scripting and mobile added no new codec, helper or fact. I left the untracked `lib/web/handlers/day28_*.py` handlers as they were."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":898,"cache_read_input_tokens":102589,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":898},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f516d62a-54b3-43a7-9d7c-f3f72d4a0194","uuid":"97cd6c8d-18a5-4d4a-98e3-508c51e06a13","timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:14:49.318Z","request_id":"req_011CgUhKQ89osHQkwu6HRyze"}
